msgid ""
"Tip: open Glimpse instantly with a gesture.\n"
"\n"
"Set one under Settings → Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → pick a gesture → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(This tip is shown only once.)"
msgstr ""
"Tips: buka Glimpse seketika dengan gestur.\n"
"\n"
"Atur satu di Pengaturan → Ketuk dan gestur → Pengelola gestur → pilih gestur → Pembaca → 'Buka Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(Tips ini hanya ditampilkan sekali.)"

