msgstr "Tampilkan gambar sampai bab saat ini"

msgid ""
"Images that appear beyond your current position stay hidden, so you can't "
"spoil yourself. Granularity is per chapter: images in the chapter you are "
"currently reading are shown."
msgstr ""
"Gambar yang muncul di luar posisi Anda saat ini tetap tersembunyi, sehingga "
"Anda tidak akan terkena spoiler. Granularitasnya per bab: gambar di bab yang"
" sedang Anda baca ditampilkan."

msgid "Show all images"
